[00:18.55] I suppose it could be true
[00:22.55] But there are worse things I could do
[00:27.11] I could flirt with all the guys
[00:34.06] Smile at them and bat my eyes
[00:41.38] Press against them when we dance
[00:45.97] Make them think they stand a chance
[00:49.40] Then refuse to see it through
[00:52.68] That's a thing I'd never do
